  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G]Stone\nlove, she\nkneels before the grave\nA\n[Em]brave\nson, who\ngave his life To save\nthe\n[C]slo-\ngans That\nhovers between the head-\nstone and her\n[G]eyes\n[Bm]For they penetrate\n[Am]her grieving\n[D]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G]New\nlove, a\nboy and girl are talk-\ning\n[Em]New\nwords, that\nonly they can share\nin\n[C]New\nwords, a\nlove so strong it tears\ntheir hearts To\n[G]sleep\n[Bm]through the fleeting hours of\n[Am]morning\n[D]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am7]Love is careless\nin it's choosing\n[E]Sweeping over\ncross and baby\n[F5]Love descends on those\n[C]defenseless\n[D]Idiot love will\nspark the fusion\n[C]Inspirations\n[D]have I none Just to\n[G]touch the flaming dove\n[C]\n[C5]All I have [Eb5]is my\n[G]love of love And\n[D]love is not loving\n\n[Sax Solo]\n[G]\n[Em]\n[C]\n[G]\n[Bm]\n[Am]\n[D]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[A]Soul\nlove, the\npriest that tastes the word\nand\n[F#m]Told of\nlove, and\nhow my God on high\nis\n[D]All\nlove, though\nreaching up my lone-\nliness e-\n[A]volves\n[C#m]By the blindness that\n[Bm]surrounds him\n[E]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bm]Love is careless\nin it's choosing\n[F#m]Sweeping over\ncross and baby\n[G]Love descends on\n[D]those defenseless\n[E]Idiot love\nwill spark the fusion\n[D]Inspirations\n[E]have I none Just to\n[A]touch the flaming dove\n[D]\n[Dm]All I have is my\n[A]love of love And\n[E]love is not loving\n\n[Guitar Solo]\n[A]\n[F#m]\n[D]\n[A]\n[C#m]\n[Bm]\n[E]\n\n[Outro]\n[A]\n[F#m]\n[D]\n[A]\n[C#m]\n[Bm]\n[E]",
